  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2202.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2202.01 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply to disposal facilities required to collect the surcharge from customers pursuant to RSA 149-R:5, I and II.\n\nSource. #14422, INTERIM, eff 1-1-26; ss by #14633, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36",
